Third-party fonts

The font files (*.ttf) in src/_shared/assets/fonts/ and their copies in
dist/_shared/assets/fonts/ are NOT covered by the MIT licence above. Each is
licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1; the licence for each
family is the OFL-<Family>.txt file beside it, and
src/_shared/assets/fonts/FONTS.md lists every face and its source.
